# GitHub publish policy
# Only publish README.md and public product assets such as images and videos.
# Internal Feishu docs, operation manuals, drafts, notes, and local project files
# must not be committed to the public repository.

# Ignore everything by default.
*

# Keep repository metadata files.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Keep public asset directories.
!assets/
!assets/**/

# Public images.
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/**/*.jpg
!assets/**/*.jpeg
!assets/**/*.webp
!assets/**/*.gif
!assets/**/*.svg

# Public videos.
!assets/**/*.mp4
!assets/**/*.mov
!assets/**/*.webm

# Public downloadable packages, if you decide to publish them.
!assets/**/*.exe
!assets/**/*.zip
!assets/**/*.7z
!assets/**/*.rar

# Never publish internal documents.
assets/README.md
feishu-product-promotion.md
operation-manual.md
pricing-and-service.md
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.ppt
*.pptx
*.xls
*.xlsx

# Never publish local editor or system files.
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Never publish temporary files.
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log
